#lang r7rs
;; r7rs-turmeric-syntax-leaks item 3: an inline C block is Turmeric's.  In a
;; Scheme source it is refused, pointing at the seam: C belongs in a Turmeric
;; module, which the program imports with `(turmeric <module>)`.
(import (scheme base) (scheme write))
(define (g)
  ```c
  return 42;
  ```)
(write (g))
